   "html": "<p>Leading up to one of 2019’s most anticipated films, Honey Boy, directed by Alma Har’el and starring Shia LaBeouf, Amazon Studios brought on IHC to excite audiences, drive theater traffic, and build pre-awards hype through several campaigns.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "the pie truck",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Promotions began with a fully branded Honey Boy pie truck that drove across LA passing out over 5,000 pies. As a mobile stunt, the truck was highly effective generating millions of impressions in addition to serving several flavors of mini pies.</p>"
