  {
   "title": "The Honey Boy Podcast",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The Honey Boy podcast featured cast and crew including Alma Har’el, Shia LaBeouf, Lucas Hedges, Noah Jupe, and Byron Bowers along with special guest moderators, Vanessa Kirby and David Lowry. Produced in London during BAMF, IHC was involved in all aspects of the Honey Boy podcast execution and rollout, from producing the recordings to editing and refining the four episodes, creating all digital assets for promotion, and securing a distributor. The podcast was promoted by Spotify as one of their featured podcasts. Listen to all episodes <a href=\"https://lnk.to/honeyboypodcast\">here</a>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "video",
     "embed": "<div class=\"p-cs__video__el w-video w-embed\" style=\"padding-top:56.17021276595745%\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"embedly-embed\" height=\"528\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.vimeo.com%2Fvideo%2F786098142%3Fapp_id%3D122963&amp;dntp=1&amp;display_name=Vimeo&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.vimeo.com%2Fvideo%2F786098142&amp;image=http%3A%2F%2Fi.vimeocdn.com%2Fvideo%2F1580181232-72f10fc3d1fcfad8511ae96fa7cbcaafc3a7f19c82a4414b6eba75127782d3dd-d_640&amp;key=c4e54deccf4d4ec997a64902e9a30300&amp;type=text%2Fhtml&amp;schema=vimeo\" title=\"Honey Boy Podcast Trailer Recap.mp4\" width=\"940\"></iframe></div>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "TIMES SQUARE BILLBOARD",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>IHC met up with Alma Har’el, Byron Bowers, and Noah Jupe in Times Square to capture a massive billboard stunt featuring iconic clips from the movie playing across 10 screens for one of the biggest Times Square billboard takeovers in history. Set up as a surprise for the cast, the entire event was documented to get their reactions and then posted on socials to raise awareness for the film.</p>"
    },
