  {
   "title": "INDUSTRY MAILERS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>As a special gift to select press and awards members, we created, supplied, packaged and distributed custom pies and pie boxes to over 100 press and awards voters across Los Angeles, San Diego and New York leading up to the Golden Globes.</p>"
